              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oluvannyuma n'abakuutira n'abagamba nti, \"Nditwalibwa eri abantu bange gye baatwalibwa. Munziikanga wamu ne bajjajjange, mu mpuku eri mu nnimiro ya Efulooni Omukiiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu mpuku eri mu nnimiro ya Makupeera, okumpi ne Mamule, mu nsi ya Kanani, Ibulayimu gye yagulira mu nnimiro, okuva ku Efulooni Omukiiti. Yagigula okuba obutaka bw'okuziikangamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo we waaziikibwa Ibulayimu ne Saala mukazi we, era ne Isaaka ne Lebbeeka mukazi we, we baaziikwa, era awo we naziika Leeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ennimiro n'empuku erimu byagulibwa okuva ku baana ba Kesi.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
